Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The tale of my past directly\Naffects the fate of your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the stones of the Orycalcus,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the people of Atlantis\Nmade advancements in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,technology that were\Nnever before imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, with progress comes\Ngreed and eventually violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew what had to be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but my father, former King\NIronheart, had different ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the Battle of Atlantis began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, history repeats itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another war!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange underwater disturbance\Nhas triggered a giant hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over 6,000 miles\Nin diameter and heading
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,towards the Atlantic\Ncoastline as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Leviathan was created\Nby the hatred and rage of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.81,0:00:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as mankind exists,\Nso does the great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature was created\Nby the Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Human beings aren't the evil ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want to wipe out mankind,\Nyou'll have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Yeru, Yeru, Yeru, Yeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeru, Yeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, great Leviathan, crush the\Npharaoh with his own darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go! No! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I must prove that my rage is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We must do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the seal of Aurichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When I played that card, I\Nunlocked the evil in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I've been\Nfighting the anger within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's destroying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But you stopped it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, facing you in that\Nduel was the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a long way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Its power knows no bounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your light to keep me\Npure, I'm becoming evil, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be a man for once and\Nface me in a duel now! Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen's Knight, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the trap card, Divine Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You passed the test, pal. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,by defeating me, you were able to defeat\Nthe darkness that was inside your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You did what was best\Nfor me and for mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:04:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrow, be strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on the good inside you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, as long as I'm filled with\Nthe light of friendship, Dots can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.99,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are no longer\Nable to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And the scoreboard doesn't exactly\Npoint in your favor now, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So why drag out this torment when\Nall you have to do is forfeit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept your destiny and join\Nyour friends on the other side
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's right. He does\Nhave 20,000 life points and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,three indestructible monsters\NPerhaps I can do more for my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,friends by surrendering and\Nallowing the Orichalcos to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me where they are. Don't\Nyou want to be by their side?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are completely lost\Nwithout you. Don't turn away. All
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to do is place your hand\Nover your dual disc and submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Declare defeat and you'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Free to see your friends one last\Ntime before the rise of the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you\Naccepted your true destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've returned to Earth to pay\Nfor the wrongs you once committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You nearly destroyed the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So in order to compensate for\Nthe misdeeds of your past,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You must join me in ushering\Nin the age of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender your spirit so\Nthat I may rebuild paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I must surrender my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep listening to the voice\Nof reason inside your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give in and join your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, sacred seal.\NEncircle the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax Let the\Ndarkness consume you Reach
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,deep within your core\Nand set your spirit free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can overcome the\Npower of the Orychalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my friends, I have enough\Nlight to banish the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So with the power of everyone in\Nmy heart, I shall seal you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Leviathan, vanquish the\NTharrow's spirit for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You must trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The hurricane, it seems to be gone. Are\Nyou sure you're reading that thing right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness is lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Leviathan is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Ironheart and Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,father chris it's you dad you're
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Back at long last, and you have\Nthe great Pharaoh to thank. He
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,drove out the evil force that\Ncontrolled you i knew it deep down
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a noble ruler darts and a\Ngreat father i've missed you so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,much dad your work here is now\Ncomplete you may go in peace great
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,things await you so return now\Nto your world by stepping through
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That portal, but what about you?\NAre you guys gonna be okay? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,for the first time in centuries\Nall right yugi let's go back home
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad, we should go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.61,0:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time, we have\Na lot of catching up to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuba, start the engines!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zetto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Yugi, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.47,0:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he's still in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's right. We can't wait. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You nuts, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off of me, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving here without Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, we have to trust that\Nhe found a way out on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance. I just hope\NYu-Gi wasn't in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.65,0:11:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my\Nbedroom, Weevil? Your bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in a hospital, you\Ndimwit! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know whose fault this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's blow this taco stand! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,where am i huh it's dynadude
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,mikey you still have that thing mikey yep\Ni know it's just a toy but soon the real
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,dynadude is gonna show up and beat up all\Nthe bad guys well then what's taking him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so long to get here and\Nsave the day already
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry he's gonna be here soon come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,on it's not safe in here anymore let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you sure about this would dinah dude hide
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,where's mom she's gone\Ni know where'd she go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,she was captured oh but\Ni promise that won't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Happen to you, and soon\Nwe'll find Mom, but
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,until then oh it's the\Ntanks quick follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,hey help mikey where are you pal
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,they took him they got my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,mikey
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,i know you're out there somewhere and\Ni'm not gonna stop looking until i find
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You! I'm home. Was that all a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,congratulations Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I caused my own downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if I won, I could make\Nyou forget about Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I understand why\Nhe meant so much to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.59,0:13:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.51,0:13:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you. Thanks, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.53,0:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm glad that mess is over now to pick
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,up the pieces i've been expecting you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for some time don't you see that this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,is where you belong you've come home no
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,longer will the cruelty of the outside\Nworld feed your loneliness my you've been
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:15:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lied to for too long, those who called\Nthemselves your friends all turned on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scoundrels left you\Nall alone in that terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,place while they soaked up all the glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.87,0:15:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And you deserve so much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve to be the greatest\Nduelist the world's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me and the ultimate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,power shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The power you desire is now yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mai, tell me this is all a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on our side, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was never a part of\Nyour little playgroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna break\Nyou apart one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And Wheeler, I'm starting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:15:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you're wrong i never\Nattacked so you didn't lose
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the duel i'm too exhausted\Nto finish i won't let the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,oricalcos take you away joey\Ni'm just glad that if one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,of us had to lose our soul\Nit didn't have to be you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,my...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Joey, but I can't face you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna hit the road until I'm\Nready to own up to everything I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we've washed up\Non shore, but I wonder how.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have guided us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it's dark magician girl\Nand she's brought with her
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.03,0:17:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the three legendary knights\Nwe four are forever in your
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,debt not only have you\Nrescued your own world but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you've saved the creatures\Nof our world as well thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to your fearlessness the\Ndominion of the beast can
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,once again flourish just\Nas it did so many years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and by breaking the evil\Nspell that imprisoned the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,legendary knights they can\Ncontinue to protect our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad we could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought bravely. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will never be forgotten\Nfor as long as we reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we couldn't have\Ndone it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In the face of ultimate darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,your courageousness sparked\Na light so incredibly strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it will burn for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The time may come that\Nwe need each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, you know where I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, those weird lights are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stark Magician Girl and the\NThree Legendary Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they're going home, now\Nthat their world is safe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there goes Hamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck's still unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Yu-Gi's alright. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.37,0:19:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrow! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd find you! Hey, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never letting this spiky\Nhead of yours out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, we're safe now. Hey, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hit the high road, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's someone else trying\Nto take over the world back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the scary thing\Nis, he's probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have stopped\NDarts, but the Pharaoh's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,not done yet now he has\Nto pick up where he left
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,off before all this\Ncraziness started because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the biggest adventure\Nof all is still ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and it won't be over\Ntill the pharaoh unlocks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the secrets of his past\Nhe needs to learn who
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.59,0:20:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,he really is and why he\Nwas sent back here maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then his spirit will\Nfinally be able to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter what happens,\None thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever he finds out there,\Nand whatever he needs to face,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,he won't have to do it alone.
